	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Type 'pad', fuzzy-search any paddock target by name. Enter starts it if stopped or stops it if running; Cmd opens http://localhost:&lt;port&gt; in the browser instead (the target's first `ports` entry, or its `localPort` for a port-forward), and notifies "no known port" for a target that doesn't have one, like an agent. Reads live state from `paddock ls --json` every keystroke and on selection, so it never goes stale. Excludes tailscale-serve targets, which get their own dedicated workflow.</string>
